Subject: [PATCH 05/17] nockchain: add Blake3 compact verifier wrappers

Restore the Goldilocks/BLAKE3 compact wrapper API used by ai-pow-zk on top of the 0.6.2 recursion fork. The wrapper keeps the full batch proof body intact and verifies it through the canonical public-value path.

